ique n'est autre que son propre frère, la lutte prend une dimension fascinante. Dayak possède l'énergie et la force des meilleures sagas de S.F. et confirme le talent visionnaire du dessin d'Adamov, qui signe là son premier scénario.","classification":"760","contributors":[{"name":"Adamov, Philippe","nature":"person","role":"autor","role_code":"070","primary":true,"dates":"1956-....","authority_ref":null,"tag":"700"}]},"parse_status":"parsed","match_status":"unreviewed","review_status":"pending","confidence":0,"warnings":[],"editorial_decision":"pending","selected_for_draft":false},{"row_no":9,"external_key":"9","item_type":"am","title":"Zaks","subtitle":null,"responsibility_statement":"Adamov, Philippe","authors":["Adamov, Philippe"],"publisher":"Glénat","place_of_publication":"Grenoble","publication_year":"1997","edition_statement":null,"language":"fre","isbn":"2-7234-2083-3","issn":null,"subjects":["Science-fiction"],"raw_payload":{"leader":"02568nam0 22002651i 450 ","fields":[{"tag":"001","value":"9"},{"tag":"100","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"20050101u        u  u0frey50  "}]},{"tag":"009","value":"  \u001fa1997-01-01\u001fc2005-01-01 00:00:00\u001fu2026-10-11 08:47:01"},{"tag":"200","ind1":"1","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Zaks"}]},{"tag":"010","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"2-7234-2083-3"}]},{"tag":"101","ind1":"0","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"fre"}]},{"tag":"215","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"c","value":"ill. en coul., couv. ill. en coul."},{"code":"d","value":"32 cm"}]},{"tag":"330","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Une fois la ville-mère détruite, implosée, Dayak a réussi à échapper aux intercepteurs.En compagnie de son fidèle P'tit Caille, le voilà au coeur du désert, prêt à se fondre dans cet univers inhospitalier, mais toujours suivi, à quelque distance, par son frère Simon, plus que jamais décidé à le rattraper. Or le Grand Désert est aussi le domaine des Zaks, les hommes-masques aux yeux sanguins. N'est-ce qu'un peuple de légende, où sont-ils vraiment là, cachés dans un dédale de galeries souterraines labyrinthiques ?Dayak ne tardera pas à être fixé . Bientôt résonneront les tambours des traditions humaines les plus anciennes, et les ombres démesurées des silhouettes primitives viendront s'allonger auprès de lui.Grâce à leur intervention, Dayak parviendra à triompher définitivement de son frère, si tant est que la mort, pour les gens de son espèce, soit vraiment une fin...Alors, qui sont au juste ces Zaks qui s'expriment en ces lieux désertiques ?Et si Dayak, d'une certaine façon, finissait par devenir l'un des leurs ?..."}]},{"tag":"319","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Aucun droit spécifique"}]},{"tag":"700","ind1":" ","ind2":"1","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Adamov"},{"code":"b","value":"Philippe"},{"code":"4","value":"070"},{"code":"f","value":"1956-...."},{"code":"N","value":"http://www.lambiek.net/fr/adamov_philippe.html"},{"code":"9","value":"id:9"}]},{"tag":"210","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Grenoble"},{"code":"b","value":"Grenoble"},{"code":"c","value":"Glénat"},{"code":"d","value":"1997"},{"code":"h","value":"1997-01-01"},{"code":"9","value":"id:7"}]},{"tag":"214","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Grenoble"},{"code":"b","value":"Grenoble"},{"code":"c","value":"Glénat"},{"code":"d","value":"1997"},{"code":"h","value":"1997-01-01"},{"code":"9","value":"id:7"}]},{"tag":"225","ind1":"2","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"Dayak."},{"code":"9","value":"id:8"}]},{"tag":"410","ind1":" ","ind2":"0","subfields":[{"code":"t","value":"Dayak."},{"code":"9","value":"id:8"}]},{"tag":"676","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"760"},{"code":"l","value":"Arts graphiques - graphisme"},{"code":"9","value":"id:77"}]},{"tag":"896","ind1":" ","ind2":" ","subfields":[{"code":"a","value":"http://127.0.0.1:80